  "title": "Recover MP and TP When Taking Damage [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "title",
      "type": "title",
      "source": "ダメージ時にＭＰやＴＰを回復【RPGツクールMZ&MVプラグイン】",
      "sourceHash": "9a722cfaa83bc5b7255144e628dab0610c7fc971c5b2d392e0ef949cf96a05eb",
      "translation": "Recover MP and TP When Taking Damage [RPG Maker MZ & MV Plugin]",
      "contextHash": "9a722cfaa83bc5b7255144e628dab0610c7fc971c5b2d392e0ef949cf96a05eb"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-001",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ダメージを受けた際にＭＰやＴＰを回復する特徴を作成します。",
      "sourceHash": "66f4bfd0a061102e247b8177ebdae615b4180f943d1b9eab936f8aef7ed68988",
      "translation": "Creates traits that recover MP or TP when damage is taken.",
      "contextHash": "66f4bfd0a061102e247b8177ebdae615b4180f943d1b9eab936f8aef7ed68988"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-002",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※小さくて見辛いですが、ダメージを受けた時にＭＰが回復しています。",
      "sourceHash": "2e74fa27cad0a26dc48fe2be2b4cab3d85ed3cb1e55303d7e52de44c7161fe0d",
      "translation": "※It is small and difficult to see, but MP is recovered when damage is taken.",
      "contextHash": "2e74fa27cad0a26dc48fe2be2b4cab3d85ed3cb1e55303d7e52de44c7161fe0d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-003",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ちなみに、ＨＰ、ＭＰ、ＴＰが複数回復した場合、ツクールの仕様では一つしか数字が表示されないようです。残念……。",
      "sourceHash": "13d0ef7b4958a9773c4604a1d1052f07d60e64c20bb4b35ba1aed5eb3136c256",
      "translation": "Incidentally, when HP, MP, and TP are recovered multiple times, RPG Maker's specifications only display one number. What a shame...",
      "contextHash": "13d0ef7b4958a9773c4604a1d1052f07d60e64c20bb4b35ba1aed5eb3136c256"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-001",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "目次",
      "sourceHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120",
      "translation": "Table of Contents",
      "contextHash": "6763aa62211b44a20c71505eed18421683192c2f2f37668012e8aaa008367120"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-002",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "導入方法（install）",
      "sourceHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275",
      "translation": "How to Install (install)",
      "contextHash": "a74eebb051e898173751a501ebea136f6891e7f24c5dc00722bd5bd693d13275"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-004",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下のリンクを右クリックで保存し 、[プロジェクト]\\js\\plugins に放り込みます。ツクールのプラグイン管理から機能をONにしてください。",
      "sourceHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d",
      "translation": "Right-click the link below to save it, then place it in [Project]\\js\\plugins. Turn the feature ON in RPG Maker's Plugin Manager.",
      "contextHash": "df37526b20b5f2ba92e3b1a5531ab0d95afff6043931b4bc2347f126750d5d3d"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-005",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "※このプラグインはＭＶ、ＭＺの両方で有効です。",
      "sourceHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5",
      "translation": "※This plugin works with both MV and MZ.",
      "contextHash": "340f20fc141f77062a4b651d80f5fa9579a7f4f61e9d652070241707a1e11ad5"
    },
