      "contextHash": "db16b64ccc528b64a0ff8adf39553bdd72ca60eb32c274c6a2d0185b3be59664"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-005",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "使用方法（Usage）",
      "sourceHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9",
      "translation": "Usage (Usage)",
      "contextHash": "25d0346b6851547b0b6d3d18bb163958617996499b78e2fa5feef574272b89b9"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-007",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "特徴を保有するオブジェクト（アクター、エネミー、職業、装備、ステート、スキル）のメモ欄に以下を記載してください。",
      "sourceHash": "5af5ccafe062581b5db1ec3dba2ecb689119a608f232d37888e4ea919295b8bc",
      "translation": "Add the following to the note field of an object that possesses traits (actor, enemy, class, equipment, state, or skill).",
      "contextHash": "5af5ccafe062581b5db1ec3dba2ecb689119a608f232d37888e4ea919295b8bc"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-008",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "スキルについては覚えているだけで、機能するパッシブスキルとなります。",
      "sourceHash": "5ad8eb8f107e691a857f2e2db77ee02e672740a0b2f547a5d1512967af79c167",
      "translation": "For skills, simply learning them makes them functioning passive skills.",
      "contextHash": "5ad8eb8f107e691a857f2e2db77ee02e672740a0b2f547a5d1512967af79c167"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-009",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "また、いずれの効果も重ねがけ可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "633b0b6b379e953d665e005fc159798cced88553709a24d5c36e68d3552a665a",
      "translation": "Additionally, all of these effects can be stacked.",
      "contextHash": "633b0b6b379e953d665e005fc159798cced88553709a24d5c36e68d3552a665a"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-006",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ダメージ時にＨＰ回復",
      "sourceHash": "5f44756550db7a58b894fc6a9f3ba33bea079e8b24b07c79bf8096023574b5c1",
      "translation": "Recover HP When Taking Damage",
      "contextHash": "5f44756550db7a58b894fc6a9f3ba33bea079e8b24b07c79bf8096023574b5c1"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-010",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ダメージを受けた際にＨＰが１０回復します。",
      "sourceHash": "8121d4daf108b51c08dd681011c2c079743125655e7d1a03489ceff79f6cc3b4",
      "translation": "Recovers 10 HP when damage is taken.",
      "contextHash": "8121d4daf108b51c08dd681011c2c079743125655e7d1a03489ceff79f6cc3b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-011",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、先にＨＰが０になった場合は回復しません。",
      "sourceHash": "f44f236032d1c97d99a5debb87ff1dae233be733813d3f48b8d910041ca361b4",
      "translation": "However, if HP reaches 0 first, it will not recover.",
      "contextHash": "f44f236032d1c97d99a5debb87ff1dae233be733813d3f48b8d910041ca361b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-007",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ダメージ時にＭＰ回復",
      "sourceHash": "9cd7f5017632fd59c798a176b39a983b5132888590e5e9e04b151b4ed0bb1ef7",
      "translation": "Recover MP When Taking Damage",
      "contextHash": "9cd7f5017632fd59c798a176b39a983b5132888590e5e9e04b151b4ed0bb1ef7"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-012",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ダメージを受けた際にＭＰが１０回復します。",
      "sourceHash": "428fa078cdfc0d69bebbd861e408f2562786fec712fd15993ff8dc87750013fc",
      "translation": "Recovers 10 MP when damage is taken.",
      "contextHash": "428fa078cdfc0d69bebbd861e408f2562786fec712fd15993ff8dc87750013fc"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-008",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "ダメージ時にＴＰ回復",
      "sourceHash": "5d22f081a23c86b4036264090bc5e732ba3155854b418679f8107413cc3f39e4",
      "translation": "Recover TP When Taking Damage",
      "contextHash": "5d22f081a23c86b4036264090bc5e732ba3155854b418679f8107413cc3f39e4"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-013",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ダメージを受けた際にＴＰが１０回復します。",
      "sourceHash": "5af63cfe6bc797250c94508dae3a62e5946e1f973b9d012c6013da6ed948ce36",
      "translation": "Recovers 10 TP when damage is taken.",
      "contextHash": "5af63cfe6bc797250c94508dae3a62e5946e1f973b9d012c6013da6ed948ce36"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-014",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "さらにいずれも数式が可能です。",
      "sourceHash": "b33dcad89275201083f7fef67db3c6eff632088201786bcfb13dd92d70b33d62",
      "translation": "In addition, formulas can be used for all of them.",
      "contextHash": "b33dcad89275201083f7fef67db3c6eff632088201786bcfb13dd92d70b33d62"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-015",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "また、『damage』で受けたダメージを参照できます。",
      "sourceHash": "fb68a68a25f590508efe026f3dfd79719fc37d21b5855ce034142908e729c489",
      "translation": "You can also reference the damage taken with “damage”.",
      "contextHash": "fb68a68a25f590508efe026f3dfd79719fc37d21b5855ce034142908e729c489"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-016",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "『skill』でスキルの情報を参照できます。",
      "sourceHash": "2beb02f5869a315bb474e82373f81757b14c09a827169da22a774a7a09d822cb",
      "translation": "You can reference skill information with “skill”.",
      "contextHash": "2beb02f5869a315bb474e82373f81757b14c09a827169da22a774a7a09d822cb"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-017",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "以下は例です。",
      "sourceHash": "cdbf2c5225f24ae8f83451c20006ab03a21295b440bea2884ecd11c35a4b8160",
      "translation": "Here are some examples.",
      "contextHash": "cdbf2c5225f24ae8f83451c20006ab03a21295b440bea2884ecd11c35a4b8160"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-018",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "ダメージを受けた際に、スキルの消費分のＭＰが回復します。",
      "sourceHash": "b9383eaf307626916f9e9277f7ea54cd3b9cd1939f00c8b541d7f037ac769f24",
      "translation": "When damage is taken, MP equal to the skill's cost is recovered.",
      "contextHash": "b9383eaf307626916f9e9277f7ea54cd3b9cd1939f00c8b541d7f037ac769f24"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-019",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "要するにドラクエのマホキテです。",
      "sourceHash": "be737dae7696ca1b02c285fce42176da71057428fb1eb3072305311eafec96df",
      "translation": "In other words, it's Dragon Quest's Mahokite.",
      "contextHash": "be737dae7696ca1b02c285fce42176da71057428fb1eb3072305311eafec96df"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-020",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "受けたダメージの３％分だけＴＰが回復します。",
      "sourceHash": "124fbf036da002227189702f6a961c66b27d5f94b970073217cd9a4099526668",
      "translation": "TP equal to 3% of the damage taken is recovered.",
      "contextHash": "124fbf036da002227189702f6a961c66b27d5f94b970073217cd9a4099526668"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-021",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "なお、回復量は四捨五入される仕様です。",
      "sourceHash": "d8f87cbf724c720420867282c04b725fd45e237ba9b3e363f0b550e728ad666e",
      "translation": "The recovery amount is rounded to the nearest whole number.",
      "contextHash": "d8f87cbf724c720420867282c04b725fd45e237ba9b3e363f0b550e728ad666e"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-009",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "プラグインパラメータ（Plugin Parameters）",
      "sourceHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad",
      "translation": "Plugin Parameters (Plugin Parameters)",
      "contextHash": "7876cc6e169aa1ffb59ad7ff0263d5dbdd1b309638a0319bcebc599acddc70ad"
    },
    {
      "id": "heading-010",
      "type": "heading",
      "source": "回復量を表示（ShowValue）",
      "sourceHash": "01e97fb0ff82af220e7b542f272b9e78edf492ec0165082c7593d4f096f6c879",
      "translation": "Show Recovery Amount (ShowValue)",
      "contextHash": "01e97fb0ff82af220e7b542f272b9e78edf492ec0165082c7593d4f096f6c879"
    },
    {
      "id": "text-022",
      "type": "text",
      "source": "回復量をポップアップ表示します。",
      "sourceHash": "a877a681138ec0153239429e01cafe92187552eb84cbbf4fde95bf15ff77a497",
      "translation": "Displays the recovery amount as a popup.",
      "contextHash": "a877a681138ec0153239429e01cafe92187552eb84cbbf4fde95bf15ff77a497"
    }
  ],
